      "content": "it's not just about physical hearing though. i've been reading that certain modulated sub-harmonics can still affect the nervous system even if we don't \"hear\" them as a tone. plus, these are high-end studio headphones, they have way more sophisticated tech than cheap earbuds. it feels so intentional, like they're smoothing out the \"spikes\" in my brain that actually make my art good. if i can't prove it with a standard frequency analyzer, how would i even detect a signal like that?",
